-CASE JaccardSimilarityWithThreshold
-LOAD_DYNAMIC_EXTENSION algo
-STATEMENT CALL PROJECT_GRAPH('Graph', ['person', 'organisation'], ['meets', 'knows', 'studyAt', 'workAt']);
---- ok
-STATEMENT CALL JACCARD_SIMILARITY('Graph', threshold := 0.3) RETURN node1, node2, similarity;
---- 4
0:0|0:7|1.000000
0:4|0:5|1.000000
0:4|0:6|1.000000
0:5|0:6|1.000000

-CASE JaccardSimilarityWithTopK
-LOAD_DYNAMIC_EXTENSION algo
-STATEMENT CALL PROJECT_GRAPH('Graph', ['person', 'organisation'], ['meets', 'knows', 'studyAt', 'workAt']);
---- ok
-STATEMENT CALL JACCARD_SIMILARITY('Graph', topk := 1) RETURN node1, node2, similarity;
---- 6
0:0|0:7|1.000000
0:1|0:2|0.000000
0:2|0:4|0.000000
0:4|0:5|1.000000
0:5|0:6|1.000000
0:6|0:7|0.000000

-CASE JaccardSimilarityInvalidThreshold
-LOAD_DYNAMIC_EXTENSION algo
-STATEMENT CALL PROJECT_GRAPH('Graph', ['person', 'organisation'], ['meets', 'knows', 'studyAt', 'workAt']);
---- ok
-STATEMENT CALL JACCARD_SIMILARITY('Graph', threshold := 1.5) RETURN node1, node2, similarity;
---- error
Binder exception: Threshold must be in the [0, 1].

-CASE JaccardSimilarityNegativeThreshold
-LOAD_DYNAMIC_EXTENSION algo
-STATEMENT CALL PROJECT_GRAPH('Graph', ['person', 'organisation'], ['meets', 'knows', 'studyAt', 'workAt']);
---- ok
-STATEMENT CALL JACCARD_SIMILARITY('Graph', threshold := -0.1) RETURN node1, node2, similarity;
---- error
Binder exception: Threshold must be in the [0, 1].
